    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/d7bdb18fa325f79af750fabdff002781.poster.avif?t=1658764103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/d7bdb18fa325f79af750fabdff002781.webm?t=1658764103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/d7bdb18fa325f79af750fabdff002781.mp4?t=1658764103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A difficult platformer with unique movement mechanics. Jump from platform to platform, stick to honey and perform air jumps to make your way across dozens of levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/6f70d121bc26b3b79f7631093d5328ec.poster.avif?t=1658764103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/6f70d121bc26b3b79f7631093d5328ec.webm?t=1658764103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/6f70d121bc26b3b79f7631093d5328ec.mp4?t=1658764103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>On your way you will encounter a variety of different enemies. Don't let them stop you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/ccab3fac26c049af0da7094de6cca46f.poster.avif?t=1658764103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000/extras/ccab3fac26c049af0da7094de6cca46f.webm?t=1658764103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016000